<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: 0, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 76, background: '#1E4FA8', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>弧度制：数学里的“天然单位”</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#CFE0F5' }}>M2 · 单位换错，全盘皆错</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 12 }} />
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 452, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
            <Box style={{ height: 42, background: '#E8EFF8', display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', paddingLeft: 18 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>角度制 ↔ 弧度制</Text>
            </Box>
            <Table
                style={{ width: '100%', height: 262 }}
                defaultTextStyle={{ fontSize: 17, textAlign: 'center', color: '#1A2230' }}
                defaultCellStyle={{ border: { left: { width: 1, color: '#E8EFF8' }, right: { width: 1, color: '#E8EFF8' }, top: { width: 1, color: '#E8EFF8' }, bottom: { width: 1, color: '#E8EFF8' } } }}
                cells={[
                    [
                        { text: '角度制', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF', fontSize: 18 }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#0E3F8C' } } },
                        { text: '弧度制', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF', fontSize: 18 }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#0E3F8C' } } }
                    ],
                    ['一整圈 · 360°', { text: '2π', textStyle: { fontFamily: 'Times New Roman', bold: true, color: '#1E4FA8' } }],
                    [{ text: '平角 · 180°', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#E8EFF8' } } }, { text: 'π', textStyle: { fontFamily: 'Times New Roman', bold: true, color: '#1E4FA8' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#E8EFF8' } } }],
                    ['直角 · 90°', { text: 'π / 2', textStyle: { fontFamily: 'Times New Roman', bold: true, color: '#1E4FA8' } }],
                    [{ text: '本讲常用 · 30°', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#E8EFF8' } } }, { text: 'π / 6 ≈ 0.5236', textStyle: { fontFamily: 'Times New Roman', bold: true, color: '#1E4FA8' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#E8EFF8' } } }]
                ]}
            />
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E8EFF8', padding: 18, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>换算口诀</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1A2230', opacity: 0.8, lineHeight: 1.7 }}>弧度 = 角度 × π ÷ 180<br />角度 = 弧度 × 180 ÷ π</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
            <Box style={{ height: 148, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E8EFF8', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>写代码时的标准动作</Text>
                <Math latex='\theta_{rad} = \theta_{deg} \times \frac{\pi}{180}' width={300} display={true} color='#0E3F8C' />
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ background: '#E8EFF8', padding: 20, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>为什么非要用弧度？</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1A2230', opacity: 0.8, lineHeight: 1.8 }}>因为只有弧度制下才有“弧长 = 半径 × 角度”这么干净的关系。角度制下要多带一个 π/180 的尾巴，所有公式都会变脏。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#0E3F8C', padding: 20, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>判断：Python 只吃弧度</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#CFE0F5', lineHeight: 1.8 }}>math.sin / numpy.cos 接收的都是弧度。写代码前先换算：<br />np.radians(30) → 0.5236</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 44, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1A2230', opacity: 0.5 }}>第 2 章 · M2　单位圆与“角度坐标”</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', fontFamily: 'Times New Roman' }}>11 / 21</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
